WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.179
Rachel: Ricky, where are you going?

2
00:00:10.179 --> 00:00:12.943
That’s my hat and scarf! Ricky:

3
00:00:12.943 --> 00:00:19.553
I have to go.

4
00:00:19.554 --> 00:00:25.129
Brian: Great, Ricky! Where did you get those?

5
00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:28.196
Ricky: He-he! They’re Rachel’s.

6
00:00:28.196 --> 00:00:33.906
The snowman needs to be warm. Brenda:

7
00:00:33.907 --> 00:00:40.332
Two raisins for the eyes . . . and a few for the mouth.

8
00:00:40.332 --> 00:00:43.381
Ricky: And a carrot for the nose.

9
00:00:43.381 --> 00:00:47.009
Where is the carrot? Ricky:

10
00:00:47.009 --> 00:00:51.000
I put it right there.

11
00:00:51.001 --> 00:01:04.012
Brian? Where are you? Brian:

12
00:01:04.012 --> 00:01:07.498
He-he . . . Sorry guys! Carrots

13
00:01:07.498 --> 00:01:10.202
are my favorite. Ricky: Give

14
00:01:10.202 --> 00:01:17.069
me the carrot, Brian. Brenda:

15
00:01:17.069 --> 00:01:21.910
It looks great! Brian:

16
00:01:21.910 --> 00:01:26.928
Ewww! Ricky, what are you eating? Ricky:

17
00:01:26.929 --> 00:01:40.211
I’m thirsty. This snow is good. Brian:

18
00:01:40.211 --> 00:01:42.733
Did you hear that? Ricky:

19
00:01:42.733 --> 00:01:48.877
Hear what? Eat some snow, Brian.

20
00:01:48.878 --> 00:01:51.269
Brian: Ouch!

21
00:01:51.270 --> 00:02:01.458
Ricky: It’s Spike and Hopper! Everyone, hide.

